{
  "slug": "keep-alive",
  "name": "Keep Alive",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Claude Code plugin that prevents your machine from sleeping during long Claude Code sessions. Inspired by GitHub Copilot CLI's /keep-alive command.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 commands** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Commands** (4): `busy` (Inhibit sleep only while Claude is actively processing), `off` (Release the keep-alive inhibitor and let the machine sleep normally), `on` (Prevent the machine from sleeping (optionally for a fixed duration)), `status` (Show current keep-alive state)\n- **Hooks** (2): `UserPromptSubmit`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install keep-alive@claude-community` from `mrzeszowski/claude-code-keep-alive`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "hook": 2,
    "command": 4
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "Marcin Rzeszowski"
  },
